  "description": "JPEG2000 (GRIB2 template 5.40) decoding add-on for GribSharp, backed by CSJ2K. Reference this package alongside GribSharp.Core to enable JPEG2000-packed data.",
  "id": "GribSharp.Jpeg2000",
  "isPrerelease": false,
